        "content": "## PRASYARAT SUPABASE\n1. Jalankan SQL setup (extension vector, tabel warungos_kb, fungsi match_warungos_kb)\n2. Buat kredensial Supabase di n8n: Host = URL project, Service Role Secret = service_role key\n\nNama fungsi match_warungos_kb WAJIB cocok dengan opsi Query Name di kedua node Supabase.",
